  "worked_solution": "The operation ${R}_{1}\u2194{R}_{2}$ means that we need to swap the first and second rows.\n\nApplying this row operation, we obtain the following:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}A & =[\\begin{aligned}4 & -1 & 9 \\\\ 6 & 5 & -6 \\\\ -1 & -9 & 1\\end{aligned}]\\,{R}_{1}\u2194{R}_{2} \\\\  & \u223c[\\begin{aligned}6 & 5 & -6 \\\\ 4 & -1 & 9 \\\\ -1 & -9 & 1\\end{aligned}]\\end{aligned}\n$$",
